#: scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c66aef216f5157b326da6ae4fd5b76b450377cd5e751a3d47926e63e43109a8
#. default-sha256: c08fa20f4187b7aa0451f23fe745755cea57672e2f657b0b79d2d6d53d65320c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know now who you are, do you not?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You remember everything now, do you "
"not?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você sabe agora quem você é, não é?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Você se lembra de tudo agora, não é?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67a5ecbc7abd04f7bff07d60d71a8351bfab3f7f99b62dbfc81fb7c9b41da87c
#. default-sha256: 9202f4227a4a67cd3917d32113ac262601812d2a050f7107c8093c6773b920de
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were present in every single era.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The reason for which is as I described in the "
"previous tale:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você esteve presente em todas as eras.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A razão para isso é como descrevi no conto "
"anterior:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 114482105656cce143a58447176829e1b31d9ab6afdf7b3112b47f6e6c9dde9d
#. default-sha256: 73c1db1b5922b3d67202caba2bfa4a9a45b200b4ccc5219fd941929348cc83fd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫because you yearned to be reunited with someone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But that person never showed up—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in any era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫porque você ansiava por se reunir com alguém.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas essa pessoa nunca apareceu—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫em nenhuma era."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d21a4f8cb93a94c275e324210d0a671d56e484ed819fd984db3583efe4367f6f
#. default-sha256: aad9fd5dfeb73bdeeb4b5159a67cb2f3206f025d6a721422edf6b402785bf666
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And poor, sweet you, having no memory of any of that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E pobre, doce você, não tendo memória de nada disso..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80dabc7a990c1ecad5c3bed9ea8755915d1e12197feed269f5a5753a559b048e
#. default-sha256: 399ce5a8477cefb7127afbcbc8ebfa7344dc3aa43c8955eded66eb1cdb83ab9a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫lived those lives with other men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫viveu essas vidas com outros homens."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a427e128fa6f8a4b3197a9399d6fe00af8204e98fc0953e593069b2addc340a
#. default-sha256: df961a4bab38d5f2cba2278366bce39267bd63200fc20e5127d92d516ea9f863
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is it any surprise misfortune befell those eras, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫É alguma surpresa que o infortúnio se abateu sobre essas épocas, então?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f40d5a0fa7034c4f177bc474d5ab39c5870e07990efdde061ff8186744e32fd
#. default-sha256: 1b8eaaa5b229660cfbf2311627683e1be32747c1f7e28c5d6e4f1080828457e2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door swung closed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A porta se fechou."

#: scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f8725fea68f77de31b48641a13c288c17802e0f60f4fa8617c77ee55aa8916a
#. default-sha256: f2e782036075cb87a839694f0de16817cbd2fccff7a95acf65107806a6b072bd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But rather than outside, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid were inside the dull, "
"monochrome room at the top of the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas ao invés de fora, ⟪k:1⟫Você⟪k:2⟫o Falecido⟪k:3⟫ e a Criada estavam dentro do aposento "
"monótono e monocromático no topo da torre de observação."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10b5530d0bb4f3b1feb1dd9f9c2d9d24ad447fa496a67db29fcf244ab9ba74e8
#. default-sha256: ff7265ac69aca9ebedee06513e7b35d66c975f6618a7791f787e316671c27743
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The awe-inspiring ray of light shone not through the lone window high upon the stone wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O raio de luz inspirador não brilhava através da janela solitária no alto da parede de pedra."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b4fc384fc3c5d3b25ca01c3a2fad811e71263fa6ee2dea13450d1cb2baab420
#. default-sha256: e1862217d4b1dc4867ba9f589bdbd07662dbf2b91c2afcbc845a784bad1c9a4a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wrapped in a curious, impenetrable darkness, ⟪k:1⟫You both⟪k:2⟫they⟪k:3⟫ stood alone in the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Envolto em uma escuridão curiosa e impenetrável, ⟪k:1⟫ambos⟪k:2⟫ambos⟪k:3⟫ estavam sozinhos "
"na sala."

#: scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48b33af39752bf7e16c2f12cd248ae2185eba5ed7ff0002b28f7c08c4ad0ee90
#. default-sha256: 4a09769300dc71532e7bfc0507f6804236893cd54e39859c7f0d36d82cb08e61
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Maid wore a gentle, but brittlely cold smile as she looked straight at ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫"
"him⟪k:3⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A Criada exibia um sorriso gentil, mas um pouco frio, enquanto olhava diretamente para ⟪k:1⟫"
"Você⟪k:2⟫ele⟪k:3⟫."

#: scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 773d49007afd5f7701bc2e00399010bd418eb2c216a215f6aaa51032616e9dc7
#. default-sha256: e9789d211550a70996a39a1dc183072e87593b084a4fd11a9d5d4b388904be5a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not your fault misfortune befell you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The only force to blame for that "
"is fate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não é sua culpa que infortúnio caiu sobre você.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫A única força a culpar por "
"isso é o destino."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d122b1e7db94cbe7b3271205332a1b942349f3830e6ee56e1f66e23330e68da
#. default-sha256: beb452494d4e28c9f525a6509614eedcab80104c9889a59e2a20e24b117d2ff3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were always so kind, so pure of heart.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You had boundless trust for others and "
"the goodness of people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sempre foi tão gentil, tão pura de coração.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tinha confiança ilimitada nos outros e "
"na bondade das pessoas."

#: scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b289a7039434b8ca01e23f1e4a90ca46fbfeee54251b825e7399cfd9a25cad55
#. default-sha256: f65c709d5cf4a7f7689842c9136c81a34eb47b9de373fd00561261df2bf6bc7c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were the very image of all that is right."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você era a própria imagem de tudo o que é certo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd13ee84869798116deae06d998b6cda959c6d1820ca06a3918422eff5604bdc
#. default-sha256: 2b289cf20cf10ca1ef9c06e5df073b51117bb01ce2d7e4c0068ba9128b1b3cb4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is no greater misfortune⟪k:2⟫than someone as pure and beautiful as you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não há maior desgraça⟪k:2⟫do que alguém tão pura e bonita como você..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8377393b11bf7dbb3a20a55069ff6257d0262e651b8cd923e964466a72474360
#. default-sha256: 9f93b55906f1b76aa510c15c01edf6d03bdee6f0e2cd1e784e1ab34cadadb551
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫being mercilessly thrown into the grinding gears of tragedy again and again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ser jogada impiedosamente nas engrenagens da tragédia de novo e de novo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf2468d3a5d5ed18ef0e6e6b907cae190c2687eb31079458555cc271e954b9c8
#. default-sha256: a3a81042998be68f5a8de33c16ba5d151f8b6809bfa5b9eed13f34a7247c0135
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still pity you for everything you had to go through.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You poor, poor soul..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu ainda tenho pena de você por tudo que teve que passar.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Pobre, pobre alma..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86225bafa1be063c3fbfb19a9eff591862f9b42a96ea907bd042a6ee3ee29d57
#. default-sha256: d40beb2abd084ee14b5b1804bf4341f0c81143c5ec03a16aaffc8d315050da36
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be utterly exhausted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantly betrayed, the man you were waiting "
"for never appearing..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Deve estar totalmente exausta.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantemente traída, o homem que você "
"esperava nunca aparecendo..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bd7faa415c670d9a0e1a0ea68e1a6583abb88ea2b0e0b21e40fa5e5093bf854
#. default-sha256: d478d4ecd8750135e505082c47d7f6609c8972d3cdce5d824d3aa98ddac45908
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After so long, your spirit worn down to the bone, you lost any and all awareness of who you "
"even were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Depois de tanto tempo, seu espírito desgastado até o osso, perdeu toda e qualquer "
"consciência de quem era."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f8b42b182d80d51099ed929c243d6cedd02ed486e2c45edc159d0609dbcf74a
#. default-sha256: 780447c2a161df933cf17f2e5b710b558fd9de07ae46d637a8e99e4444a912df
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who were you hoping to find wandering into this illusory mansion, cut off from the real "
"world?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quem você esperava encontrar vagando por esta mansão ilusória, isolada do mundo real?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_716DBB68_10D9_481D_8BE8_44D7085A4A92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
